@FraudApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5259

### Is the API alive?
GET {{FraudApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### What model and contract is loaded?
GET {{FraudApi_HostAddress}}/model-info
Accept: application/json

### Legit transaction (first row of the Kaggle dataset) -> isFraud: false
POST {{FraudApi_HostAddress}}/predict
